To have Claude to recommend courses or learning paths from Claude Academy based on how you work, you can install the Claude Academy Skill.

45
00:08:22.753 --> 00:08:30.424
You can access Claude Academy today directly at academy.claude.com or the “Learn more” tab in your Claude profile menu.

46
00:08:31.224 --> 00:08:32.100
Looking ahead.

47
00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:42.406
We believe that Claude can be a tremendous learning partner, and we have big plans to fully realize that vision inside Claude Academy, but there’s still a lot of work ahead of us.

48
00:08:42.526 --> 00:08:54.341
As Claude becomes more capable, we anticipate new opportunities for personalized and interactive learning will emerge, and we are excited to partner with our users to shape the future of Claude Academy.

49
00:08:54.791 --> 00:09:04.821
We welcome your feedback about what learning works best for you. Every course, tutorial, and use case offers you the chance to share what worked for you and how we can improve.

50
00:09:05.271 --> 00:09:07.227
Start learning at Claude Academy today.

51
00:09:08.227 --> 00:09:24.815
